          "field": "summary",
          "value": "The Eye of Judgment provides a visually stunning experience that adds a third dimension to the trading card game genre.\nPlayers compete by selecting a card and placing the coded card in front of the Playstation Eye for their respective creatures to come to life and battle on screen. Players take turns placing cards as they jostle for control; the winner is the first player to conquer five of the nine squares of the \"9 Fields\" battle mat. The gamers task is to conquer the board by deploying their cards more skillfully than their opponent.",
          "source": "igdb",
